        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Briefing Guide BG-4</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #000;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 1700px;\n    min-height: 2200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 84px 180px 80px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .running-head {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 27px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .columns {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 615px 615px;\n    column-gap: 88px;\n    margin-top: 91px;\n  }\n  .column { font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.19; }\n  .section { margin-bottom: 48px; }\n  .label {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 31px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .heading {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    line-height: 1.13;\n    margin: 0 0 14px;\n  }\n  .center {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 0 0 13px;\n  }\n  .subhead {\n    margin: 0 0 12px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  p {\n    margin: 0 0 19px;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    padding-left: 20px;\n    text-indent: -1px;\n  }\n  .f-line {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 68px 136px 1fr;\n    column-gap: 0;\n    align-items: start;\n  }\n  .f-line .letter { padding-left: 20px; font-weight: bold; }\n  .f-line .text { grid-column: 2 / 4; }\n  .f-line .underlined { text-decoration: underline; }\n  .two-line-heading { margin-bottom: 17px; }\n  .small-gap { margin-bottom: 35px; }\n  .italic-line {\n    font-style: italic;\n    margin: 0 0 14px;\n  }\n  .notam {\n    margin-top: 16px;\n  }\n  .notam p {\n    padding-left: 20px;\n    text-indent: 0;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n  }\n  .notam .lettered {\n    padding-left: 20px;\n    text-indent: 0;\n  }\n  .bottom-section {\n    margin-top: 47px;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 180px;\n    right: 180px;\n    bottom: 80px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 28px;\n  }\n  u { text-underline-offset: 2px; }\n  strong { font-weight: 700; }\n  @media (max-width: 1700px) {\n    .page {\n      width: 100%;\n      min-height: 129.4vw;\n      padding: 4.94vw 10.59vw 4.71vw;\n    }\n    .running-head { font-size: 1.59vw; }\n    .columns {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      column-gap: 5.18vw;\n      margin-top: 5.35vw;\n    }\n    .column { font-size: 1.76vw; }\n    .label { font-size: 1.82vw; }\n    .heading { font-size: 1.76vw; }\n    .footer { left: 10.59vw; right: 10.59vw; bottom: 4.71vw; font-size: 1.65vw; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"running-head\">\n    <span>7930.2U CHG 1</span>\n    <span>8/10/25</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <main class=\"columns\">\n    <section class=\"column\">\n      <div class=\"section\">\n        <div class=\"label\">OLD</div>\n        <h1 class=\"heading\">2-1-3. PUBLICATION CRITERIA</h1>\n        <p class=\"center\"><strong>Title</strong> through <strong>e</strong></p>\n        <div class=\"f-line\">\n          <span class=\"letter\">f.</span>\n          <span class=\"underlined\">Public</span>\n          <span class=\"text\">airports. Commissioning,<br>decommissioning, openings, closings, and<br>abandonment.</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"section\">\n        <div class=\"label\">OLD</div>\n        <h2 class=\"heading\">2-1-9. COMPUTER PRINTOUTS</h2>\n        <p>Computer printouts listing all navigational aids <u>and<br>public use civil</u> landing areas by flight plan area<br>may be obtained from Aeronautical Information<br>Services.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"section\">\n        <div class=\"label\">OLD</div>\n        <h2 class=\"heading\">5-2-1. LIGHTING AIDS</h2>\n        <p class=\"center\"><strong>Title</strong> through <strong>FIG 5-2-1</strong></p>\n        <p class=\"italic-line\">...RWY 27 RTHL U/S...</p>\n        <p>Originate NOTAMs on operational status of<br>lighting aids for <u>public use civil</u> landing areas listed<br>in the U.S. Chart Supplement. Each type of lighting<br>requires separate NOTAMs. Technical Operations<br>must be made aware of any runway lighting<br>outages, as this is the office that maintains the<br>equipment. When describing restrictions, use<br>Runway Centerline (RCL) with visual navigational<br>aids. NOTAMS regarding lighting aids are<br>originated as follows:</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"section bottom-section\">\n        <div class=\"label\">OLD</div>\n        <h2 class=\"heading two-line-heading\">7-2-1. FDC NOTAM<br>EXPIRATION/CANCELLATION</h2>\n        <div class=\"notam\">\n          <p class=\"lettered\"><strong>a.</strong> The FDC NOTAM originator is responsible for<br>canceling FDC NOTAM prior to end of validity;<br>otherwise, the NOTAM cancellation is<br>automatically processed.</p>\n          <p class=\"lettered\"><strong>b.</strong> When a new FDC NOTAM is issued to correct<br>or in any way change a previously issued FDC<br>NOTAM, a new NOTAM will be issued, and <u>a<br>separate cancellation NOTAM will be issued to<br>cancel the old NOTAM.</u></p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"column\">\n      <div class=\"section\">\n        <div class=\"label\">NEW</div>\n        <h1 class=\"heading\">2-1-3. PUBLICATION CRITERIA</h1>\n        <p class=\"center\">No Change</p>\n        <div class=\"f-line\">\n          <span class=\"letter\">f.</span>\n          <span class=\"text\"><strong><u>Certificated part 139 and civil public-use</u></strong><br>airports. Commissioning, decommissioning,<br>openings, closings, and abandonment.</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"section\">\n        <div class=\"label\">NEW</div>\n        <h2 class=\"heading\">2-1-9. COMPUTER PRINTOUTS</h2>\n        <p>Computer printouts listing all navigational aids,<br><strong><u>certificated part 139 landing areas, and civil<br>public-use</u></strong> landing areas by flight plan area may be<br>obtained from Aeronautical Information Services.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"section\">\n        <div class=\"label\">NEW</div>\n        <h2 class=\"heading\">5-2-1. LIGHTING AIDS</h2>\n        <p class=\"center\">No Change</p>\n        <p class=\"center small-gap\">No Change</p>\n        <p>Originate NOTAMs on operational status of<br>lighting aids for <strong><u>certificated part 139 and civil<br>public-use</u></strong> landing areas listed in the U.S. Chart<br>Supplement. Each type of lighting requires separate<br>NOTAMs. Technical Operations must be made<br>aware of any runway lighting outages, as this is the<br>office that maintains the equipment. When<br>describing restrictions, use Runway Centerline<br>(RCL) with visual navigational aids. NOTAMS<br>regarding lighting aids are originated as follows:</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"section bottom-section\">\n        <div class=\"label\">NEW</div>\n        <h2 class=\"heading two-line-heading\">7-2-1. FDC NOTAM<br>EXPIRATION/CANCELLATION</h2>\n        <p class=\"center\">No Change</p>\n        <div class=\"notam\" style=\"margin-top: 113px;\">\n          <p class=\"lettered\"><strong>b.</strong> When a new FDC NOTAM is issued to correct<br>or in any way change a previously issued FDC<br>NOTAM, a new NOTAM will be issued and <strong><u>the<br>previous NOTAM will be canceled.</u></strong></p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <span>BG-4</span>\n    <span>Briefing Guide</span>\n  </footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
